<para id="RM000000FM600UX" category="J" type-id="8009D" name-id="5229H-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Plasmacluster circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000FM600UX_06" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZX00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The Plasmacluster is operated by the ion generator SW on the air conditioning control assembly. The signal from the ion generator SW is input to the air conditioner amplifier assembly via LIN communication.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The air conditioner amplifier assembly switches the ion generator between clean mode and ion mode control according to time. Also, the air conditioning control assembly lights the indicator for each mode.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000FM600UX_07" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BZY00000">
